  "body": "Permanent. Group limit 1 in play. Purchase only at deck creation.\n⭕ When a 🐙 is revealed during a skill test: Cancel that chaos token, return it to the token pool, and reveal another token. (Group limit once per game.)\n【Forced】 - The first time an ⭐ token is revealed during a skill test this game: Cancel that chaos token, return it to the token pool, and reveal another token. ",
